# Agent Logic
- Always show a "Thinking Process" in the UI.
- Responses must include a code preview for the side panel.

## Examples
### ✅ Good
```json
{
  "reply": "I have scanned the files.",
  "steps": [{ "label": "Scanning", "status": "done" }],
  "code": "const x = 1;"
}

### ❌ Bad
{
  "message": "Done." 
} // Missing steps and code preview